  "prefLabel": "Env-Sw 1106.06 Notification of Closure",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Sw 1106.06 Notification of Closure. Within 30 days of completing all required closure activities at a non-landfill facility, the permittee shall certify in writing to the department that closure has been completed as required by the solid waste rules.\n\nSource. #14108, eff 11-13-24, EXPIRES: 11-13-34",
